@startuml seq_curriculum_ingestion
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5

title Sequence: Curriculum Ingestion\n(Syllabus -> PostgreSQL -> Outbox -> Neo4j)

actor "Instructor" as Instructor
participant "web-bff\n(Next.js)" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
participant "MinIO\nObject Storage" as MinIO
queue "Redis\nBullMQ + Pub/Sub" as Redis
participant "document-worker" as Worker
participant "SyllabusExtractor\nRegex + Gemini Flash" as Extractor
participant "Outbox Poller\n(in core-api)" as Outbox
database "Neo4j\nKnowledge Graph" as Neo4j
participant "HeuristicLoMapper" as Mapper
database "Qdrant\nlearning_chunks" as Qdrant

== Upload syllabus ==
Instructor -> Web : upload syllabus PDF
Web -> Core : POST /documents/upload-session\nsource_type=syllabus
Core -> PG : INSERT documents status=UPLOADING
Core -> MinIO : create presigned PUT URL
Core --> Web : {document_id, upload_url}
Web -> MinIO : PUT syllabus file
Web -> Core : POST /documents/{id}/confirm-upload
Core -> PG : UPDATE documents status=QUEUED
Core -> Redis : enqueue CurriculumIngestionRequested

== Extract curriculum structure ==
Worker -> Redis : consume CurriculumIngestionRequested
Worker -> MinIO : GET syllabus file
Worker -> Extractor : parse(file)\nregex + JSON schema extraction
Extractor --> Worker : Course metadata\nChapters, LO, Assessments

== Source transaction (PostgreSQL + Outbox) ==
Worker -> PG : BEGIN\nUPSERT courses / chapters\nINSERT learning_outcomes\nINSERT assessments / lo_assessments\nINSERT outbox_events (CurriculumIngested)\nCOMMIT
Worker -> Redis : publish CurriculumIngested\n(progress only)
Redis --> Web : ingestion progress
Web --> Instructor : show extracted curriculum

== Async Neo4j graph projection (Outbox-driven) ==
Outbox -> PG : SELECT pending outbox_events\nWHERE type=CurriculumIngested
Outbox -> Redis : enqueue GraphSyncRequested\n(target=curriculum)
Worker -> Redis : consume GraphSyncRequested
Worker -> Neo4j : MERGE Course, Chapter, LO,\nAssessment nodes
Worker -> Neo4j : MERGE HAS_CHAPTER, HAS_LO, MEASURES
Worker -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events status=PROCESSED

== Map existing chunks to LO ==
Worker -> Qdrant : list / search chunks\nby course_id
Qdrant --> Worker : existing chunks[]
Worker -> Mapper : map chunks -> LO\nheuristic + heading context
Mapper --> Worker : chunk_lo_mappings[]
Worker -> PG : UPSERT chunk_lo_mappings\nINSERT outbox_events (ChunkLOMapped)
Outbox -> PG : SELECT pending outbox_events
Outbox -> Redis : enqueue GraphSyncRequested
Worker -> Redis : consume GraphSyncRequested
Worker -> Neo4j : MERGE Chunk SUPPORTS LO
Worker -> Redis : publish CurriculumGraphReady

note over Outbox
  Outbox Poller daemon lives in core-api.
  It is the single owner that reads outbox_events
  and dispatches BullMQ jobs to workers,
  not the worker reading the table directly.
end note

@enduml
